5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I pulled the fortnight's tally of use by person. The data shows the two nearest the door used it eleven times, while the rest of us combined only four.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That imbalance suggests the current setup favors proximity over actual need. We should look at the partition wall to see if sound is driving that usage.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, that tally is useful, but I’m more worried about the hidden costs. I’ll check the invoices for outside hire to see what we’re actually paying.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I’ll check the quotes for the two fit-outs. We need hard numbers before we agree to anything, not just impressions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I’ll look into the partition wall and the crumbs at the desks. Sound and mess are the real complaints, not principle.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, your focus on the quotes is correct. We need to know the exact cost of the screen and the hob before we can compare them fairly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, the invoices will show the scale, but I’m curious about the daily friction. I’ll check the round trip for a hot lunch to see how much time we lose.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, twenty-five minutes is a lot. I’ll check the facilities callouts to see if the equipment is actually failing or just being misused.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, callouts are maintenance, not usage. I’m sticking with the quotes. We need to know the capital cost before we debate the hourly rate.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, capital costs matter, but so does the daily reality. I’ll check the final clear-out of the old fridge to see who actually maintains the space.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, you’ve already got the usage data. I need to know if the physical barrier is the problem. I’ll check the partition wall to the office.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, the wall is a physical barrier, but the silence is a social one. I’ll check where the last awkward conversation happened to understand the human cost.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you’re right about the capital costs. I’ll check the round trip for a hot lunch to see how much time we’re actually losing daily.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the lunch trip is a time cost, not a capital one. I’m sticking with the quotes. We need the fit-out numbers before we debate daily habits.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, the wall is just plasterboard. I’ll check the unplanned talk since the refit to see if we’ve lost our chance to connect.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, I’ve already covered the usage tally. I’ll check the facilities callouts to see if equipment failures are driving the complaints.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
